WEBVTT

00:00:06.074 --> 00:00:07.308
(laughs)

00:00:07.408 --> 00:00:09.844
(snoring softly)

00:00:10.579 --> 00:00:12.113
I'll hit him with this.

00:00:12.213 --> 00:00:14.849
Once he's knocked out,
we'll open the cage.

00:00:14.949 --> 00:00:17.051
That fuzzy demon will sleep
like a baby the whole...

00:00:17.152 --> 00:00:18.052
(both gasp)

00:00:18.153 --> 00:00:20.288
(cooing)

00:00:20.388 --> 00:00:22.190
(yells, whimpers)

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:23.391
(Lenny snoring)

00:00:23.491 --> 00:00:25.527
(sighs)
Okay, he's still asleep.

00:00:25.628 --> 00:00:27.929
- (Lenny snarls)
- (Gru yells)

00:00:28.663 --> 00:00:30.665
(screams)

00:00:30.765 --> 00:00:32.601
- (Phil screaming)
- (Lenny snarling)

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.068
(Poppy gasps)

00:00:36.738 --> 00:00:39.240
I tranked myself. (yelps)

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.408
- (laughing)
- GRU: Ow!

00:00:40.508 --> 00:00:42.677
- (screaming)
- (Poppy gasps)

00:00:44.979 --> 00:00:47.282
- (snarling viciously)
- POPPY: Hey! Hey!

00:00:48.349 --> 00:00:49.552
(screams)

00:00:49.652 --> 00:00:51.753
- Gru, what do we do?
- (whimpers)

00:00:52.621 --> 00:00:54.022
No! (gasps)

00:00:54.122 --> 00:00:55.790
(yells)

00:00:56.524 --> 00:00:58.193
- (alarm blaring)
- Oh, no!

00:00:58.293 --> 00:01:00.094
I ruined our heist.

00:01:00.195 --> 00:01:01.630
(alarm continues)

00:01:01.729 --> 00:01:04.966
What? Who dares?

00:01:05.733 --> 00:01:07.570
(whirring)

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:09.170
(grunts)

00:01:10.471 --> 00:01:12.541
Intruders!

00:01:12.641 --> 00:01:14.042
(explosive whooshing)

00:01:14.142 --> 00:01:16.878
Intruders!

00:01:19.615 --> 00:01:21.216
- (growls)
- (yells)

00:01:21.316 --> 00:01:22.417
(groans)

00:01:22.517 --> 00:01:24.219
(screaming)

00:01:24.319 --> 00:01:25.453
(growls)

00:01:25.554 --> 00:01:27.556
(laughs)

00:01:27.656 --> 00:01:30.124
- (snarls)
- Wake up! (gasps)

00:01:31.192 --> 00:01:33.061
No!

00:01:33.161 --> 00:01:34.762
(coos)

00:01:35.897 --> 00:01:37.799
- (laughing)
- (Lenny panting)

00:01:37.899 --> 00:01:40.134
- What?
- (Lenny yelps playfully)

00:01:40.235 --> 00:01:42.103
(slurping)

00:01:42.203 --> 00:01:43.137
Hmm.

00:01:43.238 --> 00:01:45.106
(laughing)

00:01:46.241 --> 00:01:47.610
Aw.

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:48.876
BOTH:
Aw.

00:01:48.977 --> 00:01:50.345
(speaking Minionese,
smacking lips)

00:01:50.445 --> 00:01:51.779
No. Nope.

00:01:51.879 --> 00:01:53.781
- (distant shrieking)
- (frightened whimpering)

00:01:53.881 --> 00:01:56.784
Come on. We have to go.

00:01:58.086 --> 00:01:59.320
(panting)

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:01.022
(yelps, groans)

00:02:01.122 --> 00:02:02.824
- (distant shrieking)
- (gasping)

00:02:02.924 --> 00:02:06.194
Intruders, you messed
with the wrong principal.

00:02:06.294 --> 00:02:09.030
(gasps) Here we go.
Come on. Come on.

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:11.399
(frantic whimpering, grunting)

00:02:11.499 --> 00:02:13.768
(laughs, squeals happily)

00:02:15.036 --> 00:02:16.804
- Go, go, go!
- (frantic whimpering continues)

00:02:16.904 --> 00:02:19.274
- (Minion screams)
- (Gru Jr. squeals happily)

00:02:20.174 --> 00:02:21.744
PRINCIPAL ÜBELSCHLECHT:
Come on! Come on!

00:02:21.843 --> 00:02:24.279
Ooh, you won't get away
with this.

00:02:27.081 --> 00:02:30.318
- (screams)
- (yells fiercely)

00:02:31.386 --> 00:02:32.655
(screams)

00:02:32.755 --> 00:02:35.089
(Minions whimpering frantically)

00:02:35.923 --> 00:02:38.059
(tires squealing,
engine revving)

00:02:39.827 --> 00:02:40.928
(Ron screaming)

00:02:41.029 --> 00:02:43.531
- (gasping)
- (Gru grunts)

00:02:43.632 --> 00:02:44.767
(panting)

00:02:44.866 --> 00:02:46.901
- (sighs)
- (Poppy grunts)

00:02:47.001 --> 00:02:49.304
Prepare to feel the wrath
of Übelschlecht.

00:02:49.404 --> 00:02:50.606
(gasps)

00:02:50.706 --> 00:02:52.173
(yells fiercely)

00:02:52.273 --> 00:02:53.341
(grunts)

00:02:53.441 --> 00:02:54.809
Diaper rash cream.

00:02:54.909 --> 00:02:58.179
Oh, no. Oh, no.
Stop, stop, stop.

00:02:58.279 --> 00:03:00.315
(screams)

00:03:00.415 --> 00:03:01.349
Oh, dear.

00:03:01.449 --> 00:03:03.217
(grunts)

00:03:03.951 --> 00:03:05.486
Get back here, you!

00:03:05.587 --> 00:03:08.156
I want my Lenny!

00:03:08.256 --> 00:03:09.257
♪

00:03:09.357 --> 00:03:11.694
- (Gru groaning)
- (Minions panting)

00:03:11.794 --> 00:03:13.696
How are we getting out of here?

00:03:13.796 --> 00:03:15.597
Follow me.

00:03:15.698 --> 00:03:17.165
Get in.

00:03:19.967 --> 00:03:21.502
Come on, come on,
come on, come on, come on.

00:03:21.603 --> 00:03:22.870
(engine chugging)

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:24.439
- (yells)
- (all screaming)

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:26.207
Mr. Friendly!

00:03:27.308 --> 00:03:28.711
Whoa!

00:03:28.811 --> 00:03:31.312
(explosive whooshing)

00:03:31.412 --> 00:03:33.047
(groans)

00:03:48.797 --> 00:03:50.365
POPPY:
I have to say,

00:03:50.465 --> 00:03:54.435
that was, without a doubt,
the coolest night of my life.

00:03:54.535 --> 00:03:57.405
I can't believe
we actually pulled that off.

00:03:57.505 --> 00:03:58.741
(chuckles)

00:03:58.841 --> 00:04:01.142
Not gonna lie,
that was pretty fun.

00:04:01.242 --> 00:04:04.445
RON:
Scusa. Scusa. (whimpering)

00:04:04.546 --> 00:04:05.714
POPPY:
Thanks, Ron.

00:04:05.814 --> 00:04:07.014
Whew. (speaks Minionese)

00:04:07.115 --> 00:04:11.787
And thank you for everything.

00:04:11.886 --> 00:04:14.021
Oh, and hey, don't worry.

00:04:14.122 --> 00:04:17.525
Your secret is safe with me, partner.

00:04:17.626 --> 00:04:18.827
Thanks.

00:04:18.926 --> 00:04:20.962
Good night.

00:04:21.663 --> 00:04:22.930
(Gru Jr. coos)

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.701
Your dada did pretty good,
huh, Junior?

00:04:25.801 --> 00:04:28.970
- (squeals, laughs)
- (chuckling)

00:04:30.706 --> 00:04:33.374
(Minions chattering)

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:36.879
Hello, Maxime.

00:04:36.978 --> 00:04:39.147
How's my favorite student?

00:04:39.247 --> 00:04:40.915
You know, I think you and I

00:04:41.015 --> 00:04:43.184
might be looking
for the same person,

00:04:43.284 --> 00:04:46.954
and I know exactly where he is.

00:04:49.725 --> 00:04:51.993
(laughing maniacally)

00:04:53.562 --> 00:04:54.429
(laughing)

00:04:54.529 --> 00:04:56.732
Thank you,
Principal Übelschlecht.

00:04:56.832 --> 00:04:58.533
We got him!

00:04:58.634 --> 00:05:01.068
Valentina, to Mayflower!

00:05:01.169 --> 00:05:02.704
- With pleasure.
- (dog barks)

00:05:02.805 --> 00:05:04.172
(laughs)

00:05:08.544 --> 00:05:10.612
Ah. Here we go.

00:05:10.712 --> 00:05:11.747
(chuckles)

00:05:11.847 --> 00:05:13.381
Okay. Yeah, yeah.

00:05:13.481 --> 00:05:15.684
- It's all coming back to me.
- (laughter)

00:05:15.784 --> 00:05:17.686
(panicked chatter in Minionese)

00:05:17.786 --> 00:05:19.387
- (groans)
- GRU: Oops. Oh.

00:05:19.487 --> 00:05:20.823
(chuckles) Okay.

00:05:20.923 --> 00:05:22.791
See you later.

00:05:22.891 --> 00:05:24.025
Say, "Bye, Mommy and Daddy."

00:05:24.125 --> 00:05:25.359
Have fun at the club.

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:27.663
- Make good choices.
- (engine starts)

00:05:27.763 --> 00:05:29.665
- Bye, guys.
- Goodbye.

00:05:29.765 --> 00:05:30.866
Bye!

00:05:30.965 --> 00:05:32.500
POPPY:
Hey, Cunninghams.

00:05:32.601 --> 00:05:34.402
Um, hey, Poppy.

00:05:34.502 --> 00:05:36.237
I heard our parents
are having a playdate--

00:05:36.337 --> 00:05:38.139
which is adorable, by the way--

00:05:38.239 --> 00:05:40.843
and I thought you might
want to hang out.

00:05:40.943 --> 00:05:43.010
Oh. Yeah, sure. Come on in.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.781
Let's get this party started,
people!

00:05:45.881 --> 00:05:47.950
I like her.

00:05:48.049 --> 00:05:49.952
Yeah, most people do.

00:05:50.051 --> 00:05:52.253
- (laughter)
- Sweet.

00:05:52.353 --> 00:05:54.923
So, have you guys ever seen
a honey badger?

00:05:55.022 --> 00:05:58.993
(players grunting)

00:06:01.262 --> 00:06:05.299
Whoa, okay. These guys
aren't messing around.

00:06:05.399 --> 00:06:08.035
There are my favorite
new neighbors.

00:06:08.135 --> 00:06:11.138
- Hi.
- I'm loving this whole vibe.

00:06:11.239 --> 00:06:13.174
You two look like
a couple of pros.

00:06:13.274 --> 00:06:15.209
(Lucy and Gru
chuckling awkwardly)

00:06:15.309 --> 00:06:17.478
Yeah, but we're not. (chuckles)

00:06:17.579 --> 00:06:20.181
Perry and the boys are waiting
for y'all on the court,

00:06:20.281 --> 00:06:22.818
and we are hitting
the clubhouse.

00:06:22.918 --> 00:06:25.787
And you're telling me where
you got that to-die-for outfit.

00:06:25.888 --> 00:06:28.389
(sighs)

00:06:28.489 --> 00:06:29.725
(grunts)

00:06:29.825 --> 00:06:31.560
- (Gru whimpers)
- (groans)

00:06:32.661 --> 00:06:33.762
Over here, Chet.

00:06:33.862 --> 00:06:35.564
Hello.

00:06:35.664 --> 00:06:37.431
(sighs):
Okay.

00:06:38.232 --> 00:06:39.968
Skip, Chip, Chet.
Chet, Skip, Chip.

00:06:40.067 --> 00:06:41.202
Hey there, fellas.

00:06:41.302 --> 00:06:42.938
- Hello.
- How are you doing, Chet?

00:06:43.037 --> 00:06:44.006
Okay. (chuckles, yelps)

00:06:44.105 --> 00:06:45.506
(Perry chuckles)

00:06:45.607 --> 00:06:48.844
Chet here is gonna show
us fellas how it's done.

00:06:48.944 --> 00:06:50.612
Right?

00:06:50.712 --> 00:06:53.180
Uh, hmm. (grunts)

00:06:53.281 --> 00:06:56.752
Oh, I'm gonna smoke this guy.

00:06:56.852 --> 00:06:58.386
(panting):
Okay.

